  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Lock & Unlock Alerts",
      "id": "lock-management",
      "intro": "Fitur lock/unlock memungkinkan analyst mengklaim alert untuk penanganan eksklusif, mencegah konflik handling antar tim. Support single & bulk operations.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Mengapa Perlu Lock Alert?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Prevent Conflict** — Hindari 2 analyst handle alert yang sama\n• **Ownership** — Jelas siapa yang bertanggung jawab\n• **Collaboration** — Tim tahu alert sedang ditangani\n• **Audit Trail** — Track siapa lock/unlock kapan\n• Alert ter-lock akan ditandai dengan visual indicator",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eff6ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:#14b8a6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Lock Management</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#16a34a;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">🔓 Available</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#14532d;font-weight:600;\">Ready to Lock</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#ffedd5);border:1px solid #fed7aa;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">🔒 Locked</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#7c2d12;font-weight:600;\">Being Handled</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Lock Single Alert",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik alert row untuk select\n• Klik tombol **Lock** di toolbar\n• Konfirmasi lock action\n• Alert akan ter-lock atas nama Anda\n• Indicator lock (ikon 🔒) muncul pada row\n• User lain tidak bisa edit/lock alert yang sama",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Selected Alert</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z\"/></svg>Lock</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fff);border:2px solid #fcd34d;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001234</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">John Doe • Rp 15,000,000</div></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\">🔓 Available</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Unlock Single Alert",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Hanya user yang lock atau admin yang bisa unlock\n• Select alert ter-lock milik Anda\n• Klik tombol **Unlock** di toolbar\n• Konfirmasi unlock action\n• Alert kembali available untuk analyst lain\n• Lock history tersimpan di audit log",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Locked by You</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#6366f1;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4\"/></svg>Unlock</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#ffedd5);border:2px solid #fdba74;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001234</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Locked by: You • 5 mins ago</div></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ea580c;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;\">🔒 Locked</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Bulk Lock Operations",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Bulk Mode** di toolbar\n• Pilih mode **Lock**\n• Centang checkbox pada multiple alerts\n• Klik **Lock Selected** (akan muncul jumlah terpilih)\n• Confirm bulk lock action\n• Semua alert terpilih akan ter-lock sekaligus\n• Progress indicator muncul untuk operasi bulk",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Lock Mode</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">3 Selected</span></div><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#8b5cf6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">🔒 Lock (3)</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001234</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001235</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ALT-2024-001236</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Bulk Unlock Operations",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Bulk Mode** di toolbar\n• Pilih mode **Unlock**\n• Centang checkbox pada locked alerts milik Anda\n• Klik **Unlock Selected**\n• Confirm bulk unlock\n• Semua alert terpilih akan ter-unlock\n• Notifikasi sukses/gagal untuk tiap alert",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f0fdfa,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Unlock Mode</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #5eead4;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">2 Selected</span></div><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">🔓 Unlock (2)</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);border:1.5px solid #86efac;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">Bulk Unlock Success</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#15803d;\">2 alerts unlocked successfully</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
